owner-spent-more-than-a-decade-building-a-waterfront-house-styled-after-the-taj-mahal-the-unfinished-4402-sq-ft-home-listed-for-2-million-in-2016-is-back-for-2-5-million/articleshow/134641116.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-mississippi-homeowner-spent-more-than-a-decade-building-a-waterfront-house-styled-after-the-taj-mahal-the-unfinished-4402-sq-ft-home-listed-for-2-million-in-2016-is-back-for-2-5-million/articleshow/134641116.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T21:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134643520,imgsize-907903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australia turned waste plastic into railway sleepers in 2015; they can last 50 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134642774.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australia-began-turning-waste-plastic-into-railway-sleepers-in-2015-saving-timber-the-recycled-material-could-last-up-to-50-years/articleshow/134642774.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australia-began-turning-waste-plastic-into-railway-sleepers-in-2015-saving-timber-the-recycled-material-could-last-up-to-50-years/articleshow/134642774.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T21:06:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134642852,imgsize-1294510.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New 11,400-sq-ft Fisher House to offer 12 free suites for veteran families in New York]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134614844.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A new Fisher House has opened its doors in Montrose, New York, dedicated to assisting the families of veterans undergoing medical treatment. Offering complimentary lodging, this facility alleviates the financial strain often linked to healthcare. With 12 wheelchair-accessible suites and multiple communal spaces, families can bond while supporting their loved ones during vital recovery times. This venture underscores the steadfast dedication to honoring and aiding veteran families in challenging moments.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-new-11400-sq-ft-fisher-house-in-new-york-will-give-veteran-families-12-free-suites-near-medical-care-at-full-occupancy-the-home-is-expected-to-save-families-a-combined-700000-in-lodging-costs-each-year/articleshow/134614844.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-new-11400-sq-ft-fisher-house-in-new-york-will-give-veteran-families-12-free-suites-near-medical-care-at-full-occupancy-the-home-is-expected-to-save-families-a-combined-700000-in-lodging-costs-each-year/articleshow/134614844.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T20:58:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134614953,imgsize-141429.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1852 California Gold $50 coin from Gold Rush era sells for $367,875 in auction]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134618899.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A remarkable California Gold $50 coin from 1852 fetched an impressive $367,875 at auction, showcasing its extraordinary rarity. This piece was part of the esteemed Centennial Collection of Territorial Rarities, consisting of eight certified coins and linked to Augustus Humbert and the Gold Rush era. The auction highlight