ort]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134642111.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Israeli investigators are expected to question the Omani co-pilot involved in the flight attack incident. The investigation is led by UAE authorities to determine the motives and background of the co-pilot. The attack occurred during flydubai flight FZ1073 from Dubai to Tel Aviv, resulting in an emergency landing. The Indian captain was stabbed but managed to regain control and land safely.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israeli-investigators-to-question-omani-co-pilot-in-uae-led-flydubai-probe-report/articleshow/134642111.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israeli-investigators-to-question-omani-co-pilot-in-uae-led-flydubai-probe-report/articleshow/134642111.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T20:30:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134642233,imgsize-151626.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Delaware school got $1M from an anonymous donor; a year later, they gave $2M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134641779.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-delaware-school-got-1-million-from-an-anonymous-donor-when-it-opened-one-year-later-the-donor-returned-with-2-million/articleshow/134641779.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-delaware-school-got-1-million-from-an-anonymous-donor-when-it-opened-one-year-later-the-donor-returned-with-2-million/articleshow/134641779.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T20:20:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xml